e001

*       null replicated any number of times is still null
        DIFFER(DUPL('', 10), '')                   :f(e002)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 812/002: dupl null is null'      :(END)
e002

*       zero count produces null regardless of string
        DIFFER(DUPL('abcdefg', 0), '')                   :f(e003)
